==Greek==

===Etymology===
Nursery word, cfr. [[μαμά]] (mom), [[μπαμπάς]] (dad), [[νταντά]] (nanny), and [[νενέ]] (granny, now obsolete).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʝaˈʝa/|lang=el}}
* {{hyphenation|για|γιά|lang=el}}

===Noun===
{{el-noun|f|γιαγιάδες|m=παππούς}}

# [[grandmother]], [[grandma]], [[granny]], [[nan]], [[nanna]] {{gloss|mother of one's parent}}
#: {{ux|el|inline=1|Η '''γιαγιά''' μου ήταν πάντα η καλύτερη μαγείρισσα.|t=My grandmother was always the best cook.}}
# {{label|el|colloquial|by extension|very impolite}} [[granny]], [[grandma]] {{gloss|to address or refer to any old woman}}
#: {{ux|el|inline=1|Θες βοήθεια να διασχίσεις το δρόμο, '''γιαγιά''';|t=Do you need help to cross the street, ma'am?}}

